@startuml

skinparam dpi 170
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontColor #213B4B
skinparam titleFontColor #163E4C
skinparam titleFontSize 22
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #567083
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 40
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EFF5F8
skinparam classBorderColor #507084
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F7F9FB
skinparam noteBorderColor #99ABB8
skinparam legendBackgroundColor #F7F9FB
skinparam legendBorderColor #99ABB8

hide circle
hide empty members
title 商品收藏类图 · 账号、商品与关注量

class "账号\nAccount" as Account
class "收藏关系\nFavorite" as Favorite #E8F4EF
class "商品\nProduct" as Product

Account "1" -right- "0..*" Favorite
Favorite "0..*" -right- "1" Product

legend bottom
  两侧外键组成联合主键，每对账号和商品至多一条关系。
  关注量由当前收藏关系聚合得到，商品不另存计数。
  添加收藏：登录，锁内检查商品已发布且属于其他账号。
  取消收藏：按当前账号和商品删除；商品不可预约时仍可取消。
  收藏关系的变更独立于商品版本、占用和预约状态。
endlegend

@enduml
